  "title": "Chef John's Rustic Italian Cornbread",
  "description": "Chef John's Italian cornbread recipe is similar to his great-great-grandmother's. It's basically a loaf of Italian bread made with a half cup of cornmeal.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
